      en: ["Brno is the seat of the highest Czech judicial institutions.", "The Villa Tugendhat was constructed between 1929 and 1930.", "The ossuary beneath St. James' Church contains the remains of about 50,000 people.", "Gregor Mendel discovered the laws of genetics while working in Brno.", "The Mahen Theatre was the first theater in Europe to be electrically lit (1882).", "The city has approximately 380,000 residents and over 80,000 students."],
