      en: ["Kladno was first mentioned in written records in 1318.", "Coal mining in the Kladno basin began in 1846.", "The Poldi Steelworks were established in 1889 by Karl Wittgenstein.", "Legendary hockey player Jaromír Jágr is the owner of the local club, HC Kladno.", "The Kladno Chateau houses the oldest local library and a gallery.", "The city's population grew from 500 to 18,000 during the 19th-century coal boom."],
