      en: ["Děčín Castle situated on a rock ridge", "Lowest-lying city in the Czech Republic", "Historic chain bridge (former)", "Key railway junction to Germany"],
      es: ["Castillo de Děčín sobre un promontorio rocoso", "Ciudad más baja de la República Checa", "Antiguo puente de cadenas histórico", "Nudo ferroviario clave hacia Alemania"],
