      en: ["The New Town Hall features a lookout tower 66 meters high.", "The National House by Jan Kotěra was built between 1905 and 1907.", "The famous poet Jiří Wolker was born here in 1900.", "Prostějov was the site of major labor strikes in 1918.", "The city is the heart of the Czech men's clothing industry.", "Prostějov was officially granted city rights in the year 1390."],
