      en: ["The Lipý water castle dates back to the 13th century.", "The Red House was built in 1583 as a hunting lodge.", "The Augustinian monastery was founded in 1627 by Wallenstein.", "The great fire of 1820 destroyed more than 500 buildings in the town.", "Six different railway lines intersect within the city limits.", "Mount Špičák is the highest elevation in the city at 459 meters."],
