      en: ["The Waldstein cloth manufactory was established in the year 1715.", "The Waldstein Castle was built in Baroque style between 1732 and 1743.", "The current Unipetrol refinery was founded in 1939 as a hydrogenation plant.", "Litvínov was granted full city rights only in the year 1852.", "The Osada residential complex includes over 400 semi-detached houses for workers.", "HC Litvínov won the Czech Ice Hockey Championship for the first time in 2015."],
